          "kind": "class",
          "description": "A real `<textarea>`, not a contenteditable div with a syntax highlighter over\nit. Undo, selection, spellcheck suppression, mobile keyboards, and screen\nreader support all come from the platform, and every one of them is\nexpensive to rebuild and easy to get subtly wrong.\n\nTab inserts two spaces rather than leaving the field, because a code pane\nthat cannot indent is not one. Escape then Tab still moves focus out, which\nis the documented escape hatch for exactly this trade.",
          "name": "HelixSandboxSource",
          "cssProperties": [
            {
              "description": "Fill behind the source.",
              "name": "--sandbox-source-background"
            },
